{"steam_appid":3419910,"steam_name":"Light Up The Town","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419910/682437054/ca63e5bb1f7b33a7308f865a7145c76949721110/1762175461/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762176680","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226131/dbc4b924acfcdebaeefa73d6e9846447be774c80/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762176680","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/1aa432f16d54f981916b456cec81ef029ad77c2a/ss_1aa432f16d54f981916b456cec81ef029ad77c2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775521556","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/dca5d1dd48d31de90d460331b64537cdaa7ca7bd/ss_dca5d1dd48d31de90d460331b64537cdaa7ca7bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775521556","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/fa988fe8678d7aa74a0398f61e5c1e6ee07a2a7d/ss_fa988fe8678d7aa74a0398f61e5c1e6ee07a2a7d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775521556","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/b2ddcf28e0f6f9365de363bd5be6b449be7c9a0b/ss_b2ddcf28e0f6f9365de363bd5be6b449be7c9a0b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775521556","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/b77a68a06982f3143980e58f1c4325f97430ea3e/ss_b77a68a06982f3143980e58f1c4325f97430ea3e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1775521556"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Up The Town</strong> is a cozy, creative game about spreading  cheer in a wintery town. Play as <strong>Bean</strong>, a young ferret tasked with putting up lights and  decorations around Bellflower, Colorado in time for the Winter Festival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/ae2c29392d23af8b31911d6d3874a2b3.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anywhere to throw string lights and Christmas/holiday decorations, and light up 18+ handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0a4a4275883a087d2d3ed2709415973d.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate any way you want to, customizing size and rotation of decorations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/0b8dd0951aed8b9337e7bff86f943710.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins around town to unlock even more lights and decorations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.poster.avif?t=1775521556\" width=1080 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.webm?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/extras/7f6cd1611d18e5bd93d2f4428ac6486e.mp4?t=1775521556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellflower's annual Winter Festival is coming up, but the town is still dark! Local electrician Chuck is out of commission, so it's up to his precocious daughter <strong>Bean</strong> to put up lights and decorations around town before the festival.  And with a blizzard on the way, the holidays hang in the balance. What does it take to make your community a better place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (3GB) or AMD Radeon RX 580 (4GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Meadow Studios"],"publishers":["Meadow Studios"],"release_date":"6 Dec, 2025"}